    "card FIRST, before any verifying, filing or transcribing: it appears on "
    "their board the instant the file exists, so everything else you do happens "
    "while they are reading rather than while they are staring at a blank "
    "page.\n\n"
    + TURN_TAIL
)

# Kept for `session_turns` other than 1 -- a flat-rate machine has no reason to
