# A TURN THAT WAS CUT OFF BY ITS NODE, RESUMED ON THE NEXT ONE.
#
# `coli-code` is a step of the colibri serve job's allocation and dies when that
# generation does. Nothing about the work failed and nothing about the session
# is gone -- the transcript is on the shared home -- so this turn is told both
# of those things, and told not to spend a fresh preamble proving it.
HEADLESS_CARRY_PROMPT = (
    "Your conversation is resumed. You already hold everything you had read: "
    "the brief, the contract, the method, the cards, and every tool result you "
